3.2 User Workflow
The program starts and loads any saved contacts from contacts.json.
The menu is displayed and the user types a number from 1 to 7.
The program asks for the details needed for that option, one by one.
The program checks the input, updates the data, saves the file if something changed, and prints a message.
The menu is shown again until the user chooses 7 to exit.
